    {
      "id": "4ef36bd8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9b57d158",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "发电机在高转速下工作效率更高，但水车以相对较低的速度旋转。 为了提高发电机的效率,在模型中添加一个齿轮单元.:\n\n1. 将**齿轮箱**块添加到模型中（齿轮传动完美）。 它在图书馆**物理建模->基础->力学->机制**。 \n2. 将**惯性**单元连接到齿轮单元的S端口。 \n3. 在**齿轮箱**单元的设置窗口中，将**齿轮比**参数的值设置为 `0.01`.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7aced613",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bb3227a6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![5 задание 2 решение.png](attachment:5 задание 2 решение.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5 задание 2 решение.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1eddfb50",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n**旋转机电转换器**块（电气和机械旋转域之间的接口）位于**物理建模->基础->电力->元素**库中。 该块涉及扭矩 $\\tau$ 和角速度 $\\omega$ 与电流 $I$ 和紧张 $U$ 使用比例系数 $K$:\r\n$$\\tau = K \\cdot I,$$\r\n$$U = K \\cdot \\omega.$$\r\n当该单元由电源供电时，它是理想的直流电机。 当单元由扭矩或角速度供电时，它是理想的发电机。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e9c39f7c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "07a2a368",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1. 将**旋转机电转换器**块添加到模型中。  \n2. 将该单元的R端口连接到齿轮单元的O端口。\n3. 在**旋转机电转换器**块的设置窗口中，将比例K**参数的**常数的值设置为 `0.2` V/(rad/s)。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
