    {
      "id": "6fa79425",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##\r\n\r\n发电机必须为负载提供电力，例如电池。 在本练习中，将使用电阻来模拟总负载。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3ac380b0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "47ae6662",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "完成模型电气部分的搭建:\r\n\r\n1. 在模型中添加一个**电阻器**单元，并将其负（-）端口连接到**旋转机电转换器**单元的正（+）端口。 \r\n2. 在**电阻**块的设置窗口中，将**电阻**参数的值设置为 `100` \r\n3. 将两个**电气参考**单元添加到模型中，并将它们连接到模型电气部分的剩余空闲端口（到**旋转机电转换器**单元的端口（-）和到**电阻器**单元的端口（+））。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "292ebaf2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
