    {
      "id": "af3fd729",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 液压系统\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cbd33f2f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "现在您已经有了一个工作的机电系统，您将用水落在车轮叶片上产生的扭矩替换理想的扭矩源。\n\n流体流动通常被描述为液压回路。 许多液压元件和电气元件之间有直接的类比。 例如，液压系统中的压力就像电气系统中的电压一样。 管道中的压降导致液体从高压流向低压，就像电阻器两端的电压导致电流从高压流向低压一样。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![5 жидкость и ток.png](attachment:5 жидкость и ток.png)\n\n</div>\n\n从水箱到水车的水流是一个带有压力源和电阻元件的液压回路。 压力源是罐底部的静水压力。\n \n静水压力是由液体的重量产生的压力。 在水体的表面上，只有大气中空气的重量产生的大气压力。 水的重量也压在水库的底部。 该压力差等于 $\\Delta P=P_2-P_1 = \\rho gh$，在哪里 $g$ -自由落体加速，以及 $\\rho$ -液体的密度。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![5 жидкость.png](attachment:5 жидкость.png)\n\n</div>\n\n水力模型中的电阻元件是控制流量的管道和阀门。 在我们的模型中，有一个管道将水引导到车轮，另一个管道将水引导到溢出区域。 阀门调节多少水可以从水箱流到水车，剩余的水被分流到溢流管。 罐表面和溢流管出口均处于常压状态。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5 жидкость и ток.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5 жидкость.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "590f9ada",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "与其他主题领域一样，建模**等温流体**需要**求解器配置**块（求解器设置）和参考点–在这种情况下，**储层（IL）**块（储层）。 罐块是在给定压力下无限体积的液体。 默认压力为大气压。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![5 блок Reservoir.png](attachment:5 блок Reservoir.png)\n\n</div>\n\n此外，有必要使用**等温液体属性（IL）**块（等温液体的物理性质）在模型中设置液体的性质。 默认液体是水。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![5 блок Isothermal Liquid Properties.png](attachment:5 блок Isothermal Liquid Properties.png)\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5 блок Reservoir.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "5 блок Isothermal Liquid Properties.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "271886e3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务7\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e5033cb6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "开始构建模型的液压部分:\r\n1. 将**Reservoir(IL)**(reservoir)单元添加到模型中。 它在库中**物理建模->基础->等温流体->元素**。\r\n2. 将**等温液体属性（IL）**块（等温液体的物理属性）添加到模型中。 它位于库**物理建模->基础->等温流体->公用事业**。\r\n\r\n将这些块放在画布的左上角，而不将它们连接到其他块。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64d16200",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f702458d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![5 задание 7 решение_2.png](attachment:5 задание 7 решение_2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5 задание 7 решение_2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a443ff99",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n**压力差源(IL)**块用于设置端口A和B之间的压力差。您可以通过使用作为单元参数设置的恒定值来设置压力，也可以通过使用外部物理信号来设置压力。 块图标更改以指示此:\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![5 блок Pressure Difference Source_2.png](attachment:5 блок Pressure Difference Source_2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n正压降值使b口的压力大于a口的压力。在这个系统中，压力差是恒定的，等于静水压力。 $P_B - P_A = \\rho gh$.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "5 блок Pressure Difference Source_2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00171bdb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务8\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8591ed3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "将压力源连接到模型:\r\n\r\n1. 将**压力差源(IL)**块添加到模型中。 它在库**物理建模->基础->等温流体->源**。\r\n2. 在**压力差源(IL)**块的设置窗口中，将**压力差**参数的值设置为 `0.981` \r\n3. 将本单元的端口a连接到**储液器(IL)**单元。\r\n4. 将**等温液体属性（IL）单元**连接到模型液压部分的任何点。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5b3b53c9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
