    {
      "id": "82c807b1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n压降将运动中的水流从高压设置为低压。 在这个简单的液压回路中，水流过管道并由静水压力驱动。 $\\rho gh$.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4322ac7a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务9\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "341c0211",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "将管道连接到模型:\n\n1. 将**Pipe(IL)**(pipeline)块添加到模型中。 它在库中**物理建模->基础->等温流体->元素**。\n2. 在**Pipe(IL)**块的设置窗口中，设置以下参数值:\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n/参数/值|\n| --------- | -------- |\n|**Pipe length**（管道长度）|   `20` m(米)|\n|**横截面积**（横截面积）| `pi*(0.5/2)^2` m^2(m^2)|\n/**水力直径**(水力直径)| `0.5` m(米)|\n\n</div>\n\n3. 将管道A的输入端口连接到**压差源(IL)**单元。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f33fbdb3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
